@startuml ISU_Infirmary_Activity_Visit
!include style.iuml
title Activity Diagram — Recording a Patient Visit

|Nurse|
start
:Open **Add visit record**;
:Search patient by ID number or name;
if (Patient found?) then (yes)
  :Use the existing record;
else (no)
  :Enter patient details\n(type, name, sex, birthdate, department...);
endif
|System|
:Show the patient's active special-case flags\n(e.g. Allergy, Asthma, Hypertension);
|Nurse|
:Enter blood pressure, temperature,\npulse rate and chief complaint;
if (New special case?) then (yes)
  :Tick the special-case flag;
else (no)
endif
:Add medicines and supplies given\n(quantity, dosage) and management;
repeat :Press **Save visit record**;
  |System|
  :Check stock of every item;
  backward :Show the shortage (nothing is saved);\nnurse changes the quantities or items;
repeat while (Enough stock for all items?) is (no) not (yes)
:Save visit as **In care**,\ndeduct stock and write ledger rows\n(one transaction);
:Write "Visit recorded" to the audit log;
|Nurse|
:Treat or observe the patient;
:Press **Sign out**, choose a disposition\n(Back to class, Sent home, Observation,\nReferred to doctor, Hospital admission);
|System|
:Record the time of exit;\nvisit becomes **Completed**;
:Update dashboard, reports\nand outbreak counts;
|Nurse|
if (Document needed?) then (yes)
  :Print medical certificate\nor parental notification;
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
